{"about_the_game":"Indie developer team Koodilab is proud to present Galaxy of Drones, a sci-fi TD game with randomly generated starmaps.<br><br>In GoD you control a small colonizing expedition lead by your appointed captain. As you delve deeper and deeper into the unknown of star systems to harvest the most valuable minerals in space, you soon find yourself on hostile waters: this galaxy that promised prosperity to the company with all its riches is not unattended. This galaxy belongs to the drones.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose your captain: 5 unique characters await your command, each with their own personalities<br></li><li>Battle your way through 50 randomly generated planets to claim the resources the galaxy has to offer<br></li><li>Use tactics and towers at your disposal as you see fit to fight back randomly generated waves of attacking drones<br></li><li>Study and know your enemy: 10 different drone types, each with their unique abilities and neat designs. You might as well be in for some surprises!<br></li><li>Advance your technology! Research new abilities and enhance your colony to beat the odds in constantly tightening situations.<br></li><li>Enjoy the super-sweet 2D graphics, the way we used to love them!</li></ul><br>Manage your defences well and you might just make it out alive and wealthy of the Galaxy of Drones!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"c4bee710f8008b957896944743b16cee8fa82669.jpg","localized_name":"First Strike","name":"First Strike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/672940/c4bee710f8008b957896944743b16cee8fa82669.jpg"},{"icon":"72562b08f09f30c4d34c79249d837f76297db3ac.jpg","localized_name":"The Escape","name":"The Escape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/672940/72562b08f09f30c4d34c79249d837f76297db3ac.jpg"},{"icon":"76ed5e8f7785d584d47b491c66ddd6312bcfeb69.jpg","localized_name":"Rock Solid","name":"Rock Solid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.s